    "It was installed without the Apple Health permission (this often happens with free sideloading). Health data can't be read in this install. Use demo data, or install through TestFlight, which keeps the permission.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It was installed without the Apple Health permission (this often happens with free sideloading). Health data can't be read in this install. Use demo data, or install through TestFlight, which keeps the permission."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本安装时没有包含 Apple 健康权限（免费侧载时经常发生），因此无法读取健康数据。你可以使用演示数据，或通过 TestFlight 安装（会保留该权限）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本安裝時沒有包含 Apple 健康權限（免費側載時經常發生），因此無法讀取健康資料。你可以使用示範資料，或透過 TestFlight 安裝（會保留該權限）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
