    "Nothing, by default. There are no accounts, ads, analytics or tracking. Health data is never sold, used for advertising or shared with data brokers. If you opt in to the external assistant, only the minimal summary shown on the consent screen is sent to the AI provider to answer your question.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing, by default. There are no accounts, ads, analytics or tracking. Health data is never sold, used for advertising or shared with data brokers. If you opt in to the external assistant, only the minimal summary shown on the consent screen is sent to the AI provider to answer your question."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认情况下不分享任何内容。没有账户、广告、分析或追踪。健康数据绝不会被出售、用于广告或分享给数据经纪商。如果你选择启用外部助手，只有同意页面上显示的最少摘要会发送给 AI 服务商以回答你的问题。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設情況下不分享任何內容。沒有帳號、廣告、分析或追蹤。健康資料絕不會被出售、用於廣告或分享給資料經紀商。如果你選擇啟用外部助手，只有同意頁面上顯示的最少摘要會傳送給 AI 服務商以回答你的問題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. The built-in assistant runs entirely on this device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
