    "This removes settings, conversation history, cached scores, widget data and any stored API key from this device. Data in the Health app is not affected — manage it in the Health app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes settings, conversation history, cached scores, widget data and any stored API key from this device. Data in the Health app is not affected — manage it in the Health app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将从本设备删除设置、对话记录、缓存的评分、小组件数据以及已存储的 API 密钥。“健康”App 中的数据不受影响——请在“健康”App 中管理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這將從本裝置刪除設定、對話記錄、快取的評分、小工具資料以及已儲存的 API 金鑰。「健康」App 中的資料不受影響——請在「健康」App 中管理。"
          }
