    "To change what VitalFlow can read, open Health → Profile → Apps → VitalFlow. HealthKit doesn't tell apps which read permissions were denied, so missing data simply shows as “Not enough data”.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To change what VitalFlow can read, open Health → Profile → Apps → VitalFlow. HealthKit doesn't tell apps which read permissions were denied, so missing data simply shows as “Not enough data”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如需更改 VitalFlow 可读取的数据，请打开“健康”→ 个人资料 → App → VitalFlow。HealthKit 不会告知 App 哪些读取权限被拒绝，因此缺失的数据会显示为“数据不足”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如需更改 VitalFlow 可讀取的資料，請開啟「健康」→ 個人資料 → App → VitalFlow。HealthKit 不會告知 App 哪些讀取權限被拒絕，因此缺失的資料會顯示為「資料不足」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
