    "VitalFlow has asked for access but can't read any data. In the Health app open your profile → Apps → VitalFlow and turn on all categories. Without Apple Watch, only iPhone data such as steps and distance is available, and sleep needs Sleep Focus or a sleep-tracking device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VitalFlow has asked for access but can't read any data. In the Health app open your profile → Apps → VitalFlow and turn on all categories. Without Apple Watch, only iPhone data such as steps and distance is available, and sleep needs Sleep Focus or a sleep-tracking device."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VitalFlow 已请求权限，但读取不到任何数据。请在“健康”App 中打开个人资料 → App → VitalFlow，并开启所有类别。没有 Apple Watch 时，只有步数、距离等 iPhone 数据；睡眠数据需要睡眠专注模式或睡眠追踪设备。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VitalFlow 已要求權限，但讀取不到任何資料。請在「健康」App 中打開個人資料 → App → VitalFlow，並開啟所有類別。沒有 Apple Watch 時，只有步數、距離等 iPhone 資料；睡眠資料需要睡眠專注模式或睡眠追蹤裝置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VitalFlow is local-first. All health analysis happens on your iPhone and Apple Watch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
