    "VitalFlow provides experimental wellness estimates for general fitness and wellbeing. It is not a medical device and does not diagnose, treat or prevent any condition. Always consult a qualified health professional about medical concerns.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VitalFlow provides experimental wellness estimates for general fitness and wellbeing. It is not a medical device and does not diagnose, treat or prevent any condition. Always consult a qualified health professional about medical concerns."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VitalFlow 为一般健身与身心健康提供实验性估算。它不是医疗器械，不能诊断、治疗或预防任何疾病。如有医疗方面的疑虑，请务必咨询合格的医疗专业人员。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VitalFlow 為一般健身與身心健康提供實驗性估算。它不是醫療器械，不能診斷、治療或預防任何疾病。如有醫療方面的疑慮，請務必諮詢合格的醫療專業人員。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VitalFlow scores are experimental wellness estimates and are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VitalFlow scores are experimental wellness estimates and are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VitalFlow 评分为实验性健康估算，不用于诊断、治疗、治愈或预防任何疾病。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VitalFlow 評分為實驗性健康估算，不用於診斷、治療、治癒或預防任何疾病。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VitalFlow's scores are experimental wellness estimates based on your own data. They aren't clinically validated and can't diagnose or treat any condition. If you're worried about your health, talk to a professional.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VitalFlow's scores are experimental wellness estimates based on your own data. They aren't clinically validated and can't diagnose or treat any condition. If you're worried about your health, talk to a professional."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VitalFlow 的评分是基于你自身数据的实验性健康估算，未经临床验证，不能诊断或治疗任何疾病。如果你担心自己的健康状况，请咨询专业人士。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VitalFlow 的評分是基於你自身資料的實驗性健康估算，未經臨床驗證，不能診斷或治療任何疾病。如果你擔心自己的健康狀況，請諮詢專業人士。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
