    "With your permission, VitalFlow reads health and fitness data from Apple Health (such as heart rate, HRV, sleep, activity, workouts, VO2 max, daylight, weight and water) and writes water intake and Apple Watch workouts you record.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With your permission, VitalFlow reads health and fitness data from Apple Health (such as heart rate, HRV, sleep, activity, workouts, VO2 max, daylight, weight and water) and writes water intake and Apple Watch workouts you record."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "经你允许，VitalFlow 会从 Apple 健康读取健康与健身数据（如心率、HRV、睡眠、活动、体能训练、最大摄氧量、日照、体重和饮水），并写入你记录的饮水量和 Apple Watch 体能训练。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "經你允許，VitalFlow 會從 Apple 健康讀取健康與健身資料（如心率、HRV、睡眠、活動、體能訓練、最大攝氧量、日照、體重和飲水），並寫入你記錄的飲水量和 Apple Watch 體能訓練。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
